</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-09-08T02:53:08" />
		</CommentCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_c15r0201_leader7_02">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>いい　めだ……▼
きょうえんが　たのしみだな……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-09-13T03:15:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-09-08T02:33:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>いい　目だ……▼
共演が　楽しみだな……▼
では　また……</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-09-11T06:27:14" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-09-09T10:09:16" />
		</LanguageCell>
